vitesse-dark-soft.json and vitesse-light.json are Anthony Fu's Vitesse VS Code colour themes from
https://github.com/antfu/vscode-theme-vitesse (themes/, commit 2862595c3d5d05fabfd5aeb50bcbb79ea2f8d85f),
unchanged. Vitesse Dark Soft is the #222 variant that franmc01's JetBrains Vitesse Dark theme (the
Theorem UI's dark Vitesse) follows. theorem-vitesse-dark.json and theorem-vitesse-light.json are
Theorem's: they include these and only clear the chrome so the sheet shows, as the Stone themes do.

